cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SAEngine in research or a publication, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "SAEngine: open-source structural analysis and design"
abstract: >-
  SAEngine is a free, open-source program for structural engineers that takes a building from
  the soil report to finite element analysis (OpenSees), reinforced concrete and foundation
  design, drawings, the bill of quantities and the calculation report. Building codes are
  supplied as code packs (BNBC 2020 by default; ACI/ASCE, Eurocodes, Indian Standards and
  others).
